<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aptenodytes-forsteri-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg wavelength at the 1.178 mm shell-thickness tier of Aptenodytes forsteri — Morphological realism / specimen match: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Direct CV comparison of the 640x480, 16-frame GIF against the MHNT egg is 84.7. The last frame is that photograph. The middle panel, after median-to-p99.5 scaling, shows a spot-labyrinth on a shell patch, and the caption states the photograph pore spacing (0.66 mm) next to the model wavelength. The score stays below 90 because the generative field is not a pore-by-pore copy of the shell." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
